{"sections":[{"slug":"否定","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"否定"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">否定</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“否定”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Heyting代数","text":"Heyting <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">定义否定算子为</span>\n$$\r\n\\neg x = (x\\Rightarrow 0).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $x$ <span lang=\"zh\">的否定等同于说</span> $x$ <span lang=\"zh\">蕴含矛盾</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $\\Rightarrow$ <span lang=\"zh\">的定义</span>,\n$$\r\ny\\leq \\neg x\\quad \\text{iff}\\quad y\\wedge x = 0.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/完备格","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">完备格</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, $\\neg x$ <span lang=\"zh\">是所有与</span> $x$ <span lang=\"zh\">之相遇</span> (meet) <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $0$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素</span> $y$ <span lang=\"zh\">之并</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在任意</span> Heyting <span lang=\"zh\">代数中</span>,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$x\\leq \\neg\\neg x$;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $x\\leq y$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\neg y\\leq \\neg x$; (<span lang=\"zh\">这说明</span> $\\neg$ <span lang=\"zh\">是这个</span> Heyting <span lang=\"zh\">代数到其反范畴的函子</span>.)</li>\n<li>$\\neg x = \\neg\\neg\\neg x$;</li>\n<li>$\\neg\\neg(x\\wedge y) = \\neg\\neg x \\wedge \\neg\\neg y$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $x$ <span lang=\"zh\">有补元素</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即满足</span> $x\\vee a = 1$, $x\\wedge a = 0$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素</span> $a$), <span lang=\"zh\">则补元素必为</span> $\\neg x$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}